{"reference":"Jeremiah 47","book":"Jeremiah","chapter":47,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Jeremiah 47 in the Book","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"In the Masoretic arrangement, Jeremiah 47 appears within chapters 46–51, a collection of oracles concerning nations. The book as received combines several forms of material, including poetry, prose sermons, narratives, letters, headings, restoration collections, and this nation-oracle collection. Its long compositional and textual history remains debated. An ancient Greek edition differs markedly from the Masoretic form: it is shorter and places the nation oracles earlier in a different order. This means Jeremiah 47 can be read as part of the book’s nation-oracle collection, while the precise history of the book’s differing ancient forms should be held with appropriate caution.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_jeremiah_047_f2fa8dd79587272f365b4773"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}